    "Extension of analytic/phenomenological torque formulations (like the prolate spheroid or extended K08 models) to unequal-mass binary configurations ($q \\neq 1$) typical of real stellar populations (Bhattacharyya_et_al_2025_PASA.pdf).",
    "Establishing a direct mathematical link between initial pre-CE stellar density/sound-speed profiles and effective background parameters required by analytic wake models, eliminating ad-hoc scaling factors (Bhattacharyya_et_al_2025_PASA.pdf)."
